A(1,"Estructura","____ the Internet has changed communication is obvious.","That|What|Which|Whether","A","That-clause como sujeto.");
A(1,"Tiempos","By the time we arrived, the movie ____.","already started|had already started|has already started|was already starting","B","By the time + pasado simple: past perfect en la otra parte.");
A(1,"Comparativos","She is ____ of the two sisters.","the taller|tallest|the tallest|more tall","A","Entre dos: comparativo con the.");
