A(1,"Relativas","The professor, ____ lectures are famous, will speak tonight.","who|whom|whose|which","C","Posesivo: whose lectures.");
A(1,"Patrones verbales","He suggested ____ the meeting until Monday.","to postpone|postponing|to postponing|postpone","B","Suggest + gerundio.");
A(1,"Condicionales","____ a computer, she would have finished the work.","Had she had|If she has|Would she have|She had had","A","Tercer condicional invertido: Had she had…");

